<title>THAILAND: Thai rice vessel loadings and movements.</title>
<headline>Thai rice vessel loadings and movements.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Commerce Ministry detailed rice loading at Thai ports as follows:</p>
<p> Vessel		Date of Arrival    Quantity  Destination</p>
<p>						(in tonnes)</p>
<p> Nokolay Makrimov     24/10/96	   5,000    Singapore</p>
<p> Asian Wise	     28/10/96	   3,400    Malaysia</p>
<p> RAB			28/10/96	   7,000    Nigeria</p>
<p> Lugoj		    29/10/96	   8,000    Syria</p>
<p> Saengthai Radium     01/11/96	    N/A     Singapore</p>
<p> Batluang		 01/11/96	    N/A     Malaysia</p>
<p> Syrus		    01/11/96	   1,200    Guam</p>
<p> Asian Progress	 01/11/96	  11,000    Nigeria</p>
<p> Iran Mosad	     01/11/96	   5,000    Iran</p>
<p> An Si Jiang	    01/11/96	   4,500    China</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
